    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "STARSHIFT\n\nB\u1EA3n ch\u01A1i hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i: 8 nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5
    \xB7 Region A + Region B.\n\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng b\u1EB1ng Unity.\n\nH\xECnh
    \u1EA3nh v\xE0 giao di\u1EC7n hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i l\xE0 b\u1EA3n t\u1EA1m ph\u1EE5c
    v\u1EE5 gameplay.\nTh\xF4ng tin t\xE1c gi\u1EA3, gi\u1EA5y ph\xE9p v\xE0 ngu\u1ED3n
    t\xE0i s\u1EA3n s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1ED5 sung khi t\xE0i s\u1EA3n
    ph\xE1t h\xE0nh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1ECDn."
